  "description": "Collection schemas: a collection's schema.usl (docs/overstory-spec/06-child-backings.md section 2.4). `accept` gives the row columns in data files, the primary key, and the @path column. Locations are 1-based lines and columns; a reject without a location binds only its code. Messages are not normative. Generated source parts repeat a template with {i} and {i+1} replaced by the zero-based index and its successor; a {\"$repeat\": v, \"count\": n} value expands to an array of n copies of v.",
