      "name": "members sort by a field they have",
      "source": "model Game {\n  name    Text\n  authors Person[]\n\n  @@views([\n    { label: \"Games\", line: [name, authors @sort(nickname)] },\n  ])\n}\n\nGame.authors[] @fold <-> Person.games[]\n",
